OL,3,AAustralia's first-ever Michelin stars
OL,4,Ago to 11 restaurants in one state
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralia has been awarded its first
OL,7,FMichelin stars, with 11 restaurants in
OL,8,Fthe state of South Australia receiving
OL,9,Fthe distinction.
OL,11,FMagill Estate Restaurant in Adelaide
OL,12,Fwas the only venue to receive two
OL,13,Fstars, while 10 others were awarded one
OL,14,Fstar each.
OL,16,FSouth Australia's government paid for
OL,17,Fincognito inspectors to visit the
OL,18,Fstate, according to national
OL,19,Fbroadcaster ABC, which is why no spots
OL,20,Fhave been recognised in other parts of
OL,21,Fthe country.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
