OL,3,AAustralia's first-ever Michelin stars
OL,4,Ago to 11 restaurants in one state
OL,5,
OL,6,FMagill chef and owner Scott Huggins
OL,7,Fsaid he had "dreamt of working in
OL,8,FMichelin star restaurants as a
OL,9,Fyoungster".
